# Case: Portable settings export and confirmed import
# Mode: process
# Purpose: Verify portable allowlisting, strict preflight, preview confirmation, revision conflicts and restart persistence.
# Steps:
#   Start production unicd, drive Desktop backup actions, reject invalid inputs, confirm a portable import and restart.
# Expected:
#   Exports exclude local secrets/paths, preview never writes, confirmation preserves excluded local state and refuses stale revisions.
# Forbidden:
#   Secret export, implicit import, invalid document mutation, lost external edits, or claims of native dialog acceptance.

acceptance desktopui settings-backup
